### Use with the "REST Client" VS Code extension (humao.rest-client)
@host = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Login (copy the token from the response into @token below)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@stockflow.com", "password": "Admin@123" }

###
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Dashboard
GET {{host}}/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inventory (low stock only)
GET {{host}}/inventory?low=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a stock transfer request
POST {{host}}/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from_branch_id": 1, "to_branch_id": 3, "items": [{ "product_id": 1, "quantity": 50 }] }

### Approve it (use the transfer_id returned above)
POST {{host}}/transfers/3/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
